        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As a leading designer, manufacturer and marketer of highly engineered, mission-critical products, we have become an industry leader across most of our end markets and the regions in which we operate.",
        "start_character": 1817,
        "end_character": 2016
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-007719",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-007719-00f3cc3840ddfad3",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-007719",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Consequently, we have many competitors across our various markets and product offerings.",
        "start_character": 27993,
        "end_character": 28081
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-007719",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-007719-00f3cc3840ddfad3",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-007719",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Generally, we seek to obtain materials in the regions where our products are manufactured to minimize lead times, as well as transportation and other costs.",
        "start_character": 29599,
        "end_character": 29755
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-007719",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-007719-00f3cc3840ddfad3",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-007719",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In 2025, we expanded our portfolio to include higher pressure thermal management hoses in larger internal combustion engines aligning with future requirements for demanding heavy duty applications.",
        "start_character": 19543,
        "end_character": 19740
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-007719",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-007719-00f3cc3840ddfad3",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-007719",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to product innovation, we drove further improvement in 2025 to our Design Power™ platform used to apply our belts by introducing a new and industry-leading Thermoplastic Polyurethane module along with major upgrades in our bike module and chain conversion module.",
        "start_character": 11277,
        "end_character": 11552
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-007719",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-007719-00f3cc3840ddfad3",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-007719",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we also manufacture metal drive components and assemble certain product kits for the automotive aftermarket.",
        "start_character": 7717,
        "end_character": 7838
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-007719",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-007719-00f3cc3840ddfad3",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-007719",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have power transmission and fluid power operations in each commercial region and typically manufacture products for both OEM customers and aftermarket customers in the same factory, which provides for sharing of raw material inputs, improved factory loading and demand leveling, as well as optimization of capital expenditures.",
        "start_character": 27142,
        "end_character": 27472
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-007719",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-007719-00f3cc3840ddfad3",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-007719",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We operate manufacturing facilities and service centers as well as several major technical centers giving us a presence in 31 countries throughout the world.",
        "start_character": 27473,
        "end_character": 27630
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-007719",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-007719-00f3cc3840ddfad3",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-007719",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We operate our business on a product-line basis through our two reporting segments - Power Transmission and Fluid Power.",
        "start_character": 3573,
        "end_character": 3693
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-007719",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-007719-00f3cc3840ddfad3",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-007719",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We sell our power transmission and fluid power products both as aftermarket components and as specified components on original equipment to customers worldwide.",
        "start_character": 23727,
        "end_character": 23887
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-007719",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-007719-00f3cc3840ddfad3",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-007719",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We sell our products globally under the Gates brand, which is recognized by distributors, equipment manufacturers, installers and end users as a premium brand for quality and technological innovation;",
        "start_character": 812,
        "end_character": 1012
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-007719",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-007719-00f3cc3840ddfad3",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-007719",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We sell our products under the Gates brand in all of the geographies and end markets we serve, as well as under select customer brands in certain markets.",
        "start_character": 3816,
